# The release signing key must never land in the repo, wherever it was generated.
# docs/release-signing.md keeps it outside the checkout entirely; these patterns
# are the backstop for a stray copy, and cover every name that runbook has ever
# used (release.key, release-new.key, release-signing-key*).
release-signing-key*
release*.key
*.key

